 worksheet this guide is  here to help you do on top of sharing my  story on top of all the exercises that  you go through I'm also going to give  you bonus advice and famous  entrepreneurs and how they found their  passion people like Martha Stewart  people like Oprah Winfrey Donald Trump  Anthony Robbins how they got started how  they  on their passion and turned it into a  successful company guys this is the most  important exercise that you're going to  do with your business every other  business rule principle strategy will  not help you will not save you unless  you're doing a business that you are  passionate about it's the ultimate  question to start off with so if you're  in that spot right now where you're not  sure your passion is you're not sure  what businesses start you just know that  you need to get out of whatever  situation you're in right now you need  to get our that job either get out of  that career you need to start something  on your own you're in that spot and you  know you want to build something that  you can be proud of then this guide will  be one of the best investments that you  ever make in your life I honestly deeply  profoundly believe that so I hope you  check it out if you have any questions  let me know follow your passion and  continue to believe
 

